config OPLUS_FEATURE_SIGKILL_DIAGNOSIS
	bool "sigkill diagnosis driver"
	default n
	help
	  Assist SIGKILL diagnosis by recording kill reason categories for
	  Athena. The 4.14 port is built-in because kernel/signal.c calls the
	  recorder directly in place of the 5.4 Android vendor hook.
